OL,3,AKing to open Commonwealth summit as
OL,4,ABurnham begins talks on slavery apology
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III is due to formally
OL,7,Fopen the Commonwealth Heads of
OL,8,FGovernment Meeting (Chogm) in Antigua
OL,9,Fand Barbuda with a speech this
OL,10,Fafternoon
OL,12,FBuckingham Palace says the King will
OL,13,Fspeak with "unflinching honesty" and
OL,14,F"sincere sorrow" about the lasting pain
OL,15,Fof the transatlantic slave trade
OL,17,FIt will be a tough room for the King,
OL,18,Fthe reception will likely be polite but
OL,19,Friddled with underlying issues, our
OL,20,Fsenior royal correspondent writes
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
