OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKing to open Commonwealth summit as
OL,4,ABurnham begins talks on slavery apology
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlso in attendance will be British
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham, who says
OL,8,Fhe is "open" to a formal apology from
OL,9,Fthe UK over slavery, but said
OL,10,Freparations were "not the right answer"
OL,12,FAs part of talks with fellow leaders,
OL,13,FBurnham is expected to set out plans
OL,14,Ffor a "debt reset" to support
OL,15,FCommonwealth countries dealing with the
OL,16,Fgrowing cost of paying interest
OL,18,FThe Commonwealth leaders' summit is
OL,19,Fheld every two years and allows leaders
OL,20,Fand representatives of the 56 nations
OL,21,Fto discuss the future of the
OL,22,Fpartnership
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
